.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt TIMER_SET 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm timer_set
.Nd arm or disarm a timer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn timer_set timer initial_ns interval_ns
.Sh DESCRIPTION
An initial value of zero disarms the timer.  A nonzero interval makes it
periodic; periodic deadlines advance from the prior deadline to avoid drift.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
